This monograph presents the complete theoretical foundation, numerical validation,
cryptographic attestation, and multi-physics architecture of the Unified Astrophysical
Simulation \& Cryptographic Provenance Engine (UAS-CPE). The system integrates relativistic
field equations, Hamiltonian symplectic mechanics, magnetohydrodynamics, thermodynamics,
and zero-knowledge cryptographic proofs into a unified simulation core. All invariants are
validated to machine precision across $2.5\times10^5$ epochs.
\end{abstract}

